{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0258","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000000ff:text","row":35366,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"自宅。","en":"Home.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900130","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00001","en":"My home.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:0000011d:text","row":35367,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"いつも寂しい空間に、今日は華がある。","en":"Today, my usually lonely space has a touch of beauty.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900131","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00002","en":"In this space, always so lonely, today there blooms a flower.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000161:text","row":35368,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「さ、入って」","en":"“Come in.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900132","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00003","en":"Taichi: \"Well, come in.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:0000020b:text","row":35369,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「お、お邪魔します……」","en":"“S-sorry to intrude...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900133","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00004","en":"Kiri: \"S-, sorry for intruding...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000002bf:text","row":35370,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「うわあ」","en":"“Wow.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900134","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00005","en":"Kiri: \"Whoa...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000002e1:text","row":35371,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"混沌を愛する俺の部屋だった。","en":"My room: home to a man who loves chaos.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900135","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00006","en":"My room was a lover of chaos and disorder.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["wrong_subject","word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000315:text","row":35372,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"客はたいてい驚く。","en":"Most visitors are astonished.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900136","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00007","en":"Guests were usually astonished.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000347:text","row":35373,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「座りたまへ」","en":"“Pray, be seated.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900137","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00008","en":"Taichi: \"Gladden me with sitting.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","register_voice","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese is an affected, old-fashioned command to sit. It does not say that sitting will gladden the speaker; that motive is invented.","remedy":"Pray, have a seat.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":33,"start":9,"text":"Gladden me with sitting."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000003f1:text","row":35374,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「……どこに座れと」","en":"“...Where exactly do you expect me to sit?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900138","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00009","en":"Kiri: \"...where would I even sit.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000425:text","row":35375,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Here you go.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900139","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00010","en":"Taichi: \"Here.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000445:text","row":35376,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"トンボを渡す。","en":"I hand her a rake.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900140","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00011","en":"I pass the Tonbo mud rake.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000004ef:text","row":35377,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「……はいって」","en":"“...‘Here you go’?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900141","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00012","en":"Kiri: \"...here, you say.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:0000051f:text","row":35378,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「座りたい場所にスペース作ってね」","en":"“Clear yourself a space wherever you want to sit.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900142","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00013","en":"Taichi: \"Make space in whatever place you want to sit.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000005c0:text","row":35379,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「……………………」","en":"“……………………”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900143","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00014","en":"Kiri: \"............\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000005ec:text","row":35380,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"自己責任。","en":"Her own responsibility.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900144","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00015","en":"At her own risk and responsibility,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:0000060e:text","row":35381,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"霧はトンボをかけて作った隙間に、ぎこちなく正座する。","en":"Kiri kneels stiffly in the gap she clears with the rake.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900145","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00016","en":"Kiri sits in an awkward seiza in the gap made by the tonbo.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:0000067d:text","row":35382,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「……男の人って」","en":"“...Men are...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900146","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00017","en":"Kiri: \"...men...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000710:text","row":35383,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「ちょっと待っててねー」","en":"“Wait right there.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900147","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00018","en":"Taichi: \"Wait up here a biiit.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000818:text","row":35384,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"階下に降りてトマトを持ってくる。","en":"I go downstairs and return with a tomato.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900148","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00019","en":"I fly down to the floor below and bring tomatoes back.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000930:text","row":35385,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい、ビタミン」","en":"“Here. Vitamins.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900149","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Here, vitamins.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000009de:text","row":35386,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「……どうも」","en":"“…Thanks.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900150","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00021","en":"Kiri: \"...thanks.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000a04:text","row":35387,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"おどおどと、トマトを囓る。","en":"She takes a nervous bite of the tomato.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900151","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00022","en":"Timidly and hesitatingly, she gnaws into the tomato.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000a3e:text","row":35388,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「リラックスしていいよ。ずっと住むんだし」","en":"“You can relax. You're going to live here for good.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900152","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00023","en":"Taichi: \"Feel free to relax! You will always live here.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000aa3:text","row":35389,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ん」","en":"“……Mm.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900153","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00024","en":"Kiri: \"...ngh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000ac5:text","row":35390,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"ぴた、と動きが止まる。","en":"She stops dead.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900154","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00025","en":"All motions come to a halt on the spot.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000b77:text","row":35391,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「ずっと……ですか」","en":"“For good...?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900155","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00026","en":"Kiri: \"Always... you say?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000bab:text","row":35392,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや？」","en":"“You don't want to?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900156","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00027","en":"Taichi: \"No like?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000c51:text","row":35393,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「……わかりません」","en":"“...I don't know.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900157","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00028","en":"Kiri: \"...I do not understand.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","word_choice"],"assessment":"In response to whether she dislikes the prospect, the Japanese means that she does not know how she feels. 'I do not understand' instead presents a failure to comprehend the question or situation.","remedy":"...I don't know.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":30,"start":10,"text":"I do not understand."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000d01:text","row":35394,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「もう先輩は、わたしの初めての人なので……」","en":"“You're the first person I've ever been with, Kurosu...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900158","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00029","en":"Kiri: \"And now that Senpai has been... my first man...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000d45:text","row":35395,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"うわあ。","en":"Yikes.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900159","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00030","en":"Whoa.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000de9:text","row":35396,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「それに、わたしはこれを償いだと思ってます」","en":"“Besides, I think of this as atonement.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900160","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00031","en":"Kiri: \"And, I think of this as a compensation.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese identifies the act as atonement or making amends. 'Compensation' suggests payment or recompense and weakens the explicitly moral, guilt-bound sense.","remedy":"And I think of this as atonement.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":45,"start":31,"text":"a compensation"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000e50:text","row":35397,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「豊とわたしの、二人分の」","en":"“For both Yutaka and me.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900161","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00032","en":"Kiri: \"My share and Yutaka's.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000e82:text","row":35398,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"豊、か。","en":"Yutaka, huh.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900162","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00033","en":"Yutaka, then.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000ea2:text","row":35399,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"霧はどこまでも、そういう者であり続けるんだろうな。","en":"I suppose that's who Kiri will always be.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900163","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00034","en":"No matter when no matter where, Kiri would still continue to be that kind of person.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000eec:text","row":35400,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"豊。豊。豊。","en":"Yutaka. Yutaka. Yutaka.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900164","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00035","en":"Yutaka. Yutaka. Yutaka.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000f10:text","row":35401,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"豊。","en":"Yutaka.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900165","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00036","en":"Yutaka.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000f34:text","row":35402,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「……トマト、食べさせてあげようか」","en":"“...Want me to feed you the tomato?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900166","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00037","en":"Taichi: \"...do you want me to feed that tomato to you?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00000ff4:text","row":35403,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「え？」","en":"“Huh?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900167","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00038","en":"Kiri: \"Eh?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001014:text","row":35404,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"霧のトマトを取って、かぶりつく。","en":"I take Kiri's tomato and bite into it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900168","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00039","en":"I grab Kiri's tomato, and bite into it,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:0000104c:text","row":35405,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"それを幾度か噛みつぶし、キスをする。","en":"I chew it a few times, then kiss her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900169","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00040","en":"and after chewing it for so many times, I kiss her.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:0000110c:text","row":35406,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「んっ！？」","en":"“Mm!?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900170","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00041","en":"Kiri: \"Ngh-?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001130:text","row":35407,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"唾液とともに流し込んだ。","en":"I push it into her mouth with my saliva.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900171","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00042","en":"I poured it inside her mouth, together with saliva.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000011e4:text","row":35408,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ん、ふぁ……んくっ、ん、んんんん」","en":"“...Mm, ah...nngh, mm, mmmmm.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900172","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00043","en":"Kiri: \"...nh, hfhah... nkh, nh, nnnnh!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001224:text","row":35409,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"抵抗は最初だけ。","en":"She only resists at first.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900173","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00044","en":"She only had opposition at the outset.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001254:text","row":35410,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「おいしい？」","en":"“Tasty?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900174","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00045","en":"Taichi: \"Delicious?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000012fe:text","row":35411,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「……はい」","en":"“...Yes.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900175","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00046","en":"Kiri: \"...yes.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:0000132a:text","row":35412,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃもっと食べなよ」","en":"“Then have some more.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900176","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00047","en":"Taichi: \"Then eat some more!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001358:text","row":35413,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"幾度か繰り返す。","en":"I repeat it several times.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900177","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00048","en":"I repeat this several times.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001380:text","row":35414,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"終わる頃には、霧は上気していた。","en":"By the time it's over, Kiri is flushed.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900178","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00049","en":"By the time we finished, Kiri's cheeks were flushed.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000013c0:text","row":35415,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"「霧は俺だけの霧だよな」","en":"“You're my Kiri and no one else's, right?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900179","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00050","en":"Taichi: \"Kiri is my Kiri alone now.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001474:text","row":35416,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「……そうですね」","en":"“...I suppose so.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900180","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00051","en":"Kiri: \"...so I am.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000014a6:text","row":35417,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「でも、悲しそうだよ」","en":"“But you look sad.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900181","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00052","en":"Taichi: \"But... you seem so sad.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001535:text","row":35418,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"そう言うと、霧は無理をして微笑んだ。","en":"At that, Kiri forces a smile.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900182","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00053","en":"On saying that, Kiri forcefully makes a smile.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001571:text","row":35419,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"……引きつったようにしか見えなかった。","en":"...It looks like nothing more than a grimace.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900183","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00054","en":"...I did not see it as being anything more than a drawing of the lips.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["undertranslation","word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001667:text","row":35420,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"抱きしめて、そっと押し倒した。","en":"I embrace her and gently push her down.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900184","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00055","en":"I embrace her, and slowly pushed her down.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000016c0:text","row":35421,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ……」","en":"“Ah...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900185","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00056","en":"Kiri: \"Ah...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000017b3:text","row":35422,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"食べかけの果実が床に落ちた。","en":"The half-eaten fruit drops to the floor.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900186","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00057","en":"The half-eaten fruit fell to the floor.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000018bb:text","row":35423,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"深夜の祠は不気味だ。","en":"The shrine is eerie at midnight.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900187","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00058","en":"The hokora is spooky in the dead of night.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000018e7:text","row":35424,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"日記を収める。","en":"I place the diary inside.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900188","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00059","en":"I offer it the diary.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["overinterpretation","word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:0000190d:text","row":35425,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"六冊目のノート。","en":"The sixth notebook.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900189","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00060","en":"It is the sixth notebook.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:0000193d:text","row":35426,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900190","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00061","en":"Taichi: \"Right.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:0000195f:text","row":35427,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"ふと考える。","en":"A thought occurs to me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900191","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00062","en":"Unexpectedly, a thought.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001983:text","row":35428,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"日記として使っていたノートがここに安置される。","en":"The notebook I used as a diary now rests here.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900192","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00063","en":"The notebooks used as diaries will be enshrined here.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000019c9:text","row":35429,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"明日以降に世界は巻き戻される。","en":"Starting tomorrow, the world will be rewound.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900193","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00064","en":"The world is rewound sometime starting tomorrow.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:000019ff:text","row":35430,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"だからノートが消える。","en":"That is why the notebook disappears.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900194","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00065","en":"Therefore, the notebooks will disappear.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001a2d:text","row":35431,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"月曜日に日記を書こうとして、見つからなかった道理である。","en":"No wonder I could not find it when I tried to write in the diary on Monday.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900195","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00066","en":"It's no wonder that, Monday, I just couldn't find the diary I wanted to write on.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001a7d:text","row":35432,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"祠の内部は、本当に巻き戻しとは違う法則に切り分けられているらしい。","en":"It seems the inside of the shrine really is partitioned off, governed by rules separate from the rewind.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900196","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00067","en":"The inside of the hokora seems, truly, carved from different rules than those that govern the rewinding.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001adf:text","row":35433,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"「なるほどね……」","en":"“That makes sense...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900197","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00068","en":"Taichi: \"I get it now...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001b09:text","row":35434,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"日記は置いた。","en":"The diary is in place.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900198","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00069","en":"I placed the diary.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001b2f:text","row":35435,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"セーブしたんだ。","en":"I made my save.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900199","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00070","en":"This is the act of saving.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001b57:text","row":35436,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"最後の日記を書いた瞬間から、俺の……俺個人だけの人生がはじまる。","en":"Now that I've written the final diary entry, my... my life, mine alone, begins.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900200","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00071","en":"From the last moment I wrote the diary onwards, the... personal individual life for myself only begins.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001baf:text","row":35437,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"やり直しはない。","en":"There will be no do-over.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900201","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00072","en":"There'll be no redoing.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001bd7:text","row":35438,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"たった一日、あるかないかの人生だ。","en":"A life of barely one day, if that.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900202","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00073","en":"It's a life of a single solitary day, that may not even be life.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation","addition"],"assessment":"The Japanese says the life may not even amount to a full day. The English instead questions whether the span qualifies as life at all, changing the object of uncertainty.","remedy":"It would be a life of a single day, if even that.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":63,"start":38,"text":"that may not even be life"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0258:00001c11:text","row":35439,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"好きなように生きて消えようと思った。","en":"I decide to live as I please, then disappear.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900203","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc3029:00074","en":"I thought I would live as I please, and then disappear.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
